[
  {
    "content_id": "10051001001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;奉　神旨意，作基督耶稣使徒的保罗和兄弟提摩太</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;写信给歌罗西的圣徒，在基督里有忠心的弟兄。愿恩惠、平安从　神我们的父归与你们！</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;我们感谢　神我们主耶稣基督的父，常常为你们祷告；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;因听见你们在基督耶稣里的信心，并向众圣徒的爱心，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;是为那给你们存在天上的盼望；这盼望就是你们从前在福音真理的道上所听见的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;这福音传到你们那里，也传到普天之下，并且结果，增长，如同在你们中间，自从你们听见福音，真知道　神恩惠的日子一样。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;正如你们从我们所亲爱、一同作仆人的以巴弗所学的。他为我们作了基督忠心的执事，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;也把你们因圣灵所存的爱心告诉了我们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;因此，我们自从听见的日子，也就为你们不住地祷告祈求，愿你们在一切属灵的智慧悟性上，满心知道　神的旨意；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;好叫你们行事为人对得起主，凡事蒙他喜悦，在一切善事上结果子，渐渐地多知道　神；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;照他荣耀的权能，得以在各样的力上加力，好叫你们凡事欢欢喜喜地忍耐宽容；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;又感谢父，叫我们能与众圣徒在光明中同得基业。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他救了我们脱离黑暗的权势，把我们迁到他爱子的国里；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;我们在爱子里得蒙救赎，罪过得以赦免。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;爱子是那不能看见之　神的像，是首生的，在一切被造的以先。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;因为万有都是靠他造的，无论是天上的，地上的；能看见的，不能看见的；或是有位的，主治的，执政的，掌权的；一概都是借着他造的，又是为他造的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;他在万有之先；万有也靠他而立。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;他也是教会全体之首。他是元始，是从死里首先复生的，使他可以在凡事上居首位。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;因为父喜欢叫一切的丰盛在他里面居住。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;既然借着他在十字架上所流的血成就了和平，便借着他叫万有—无论是地上的、天上的—都与自己和好了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你们从前与　神隔绝，因着恶行，心里与他为敌。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;但如今他借着基督的肉身受死，叫你们与自己和好，都成了圣洁，没有瑕疵，无可责备，把你们引到自己面前。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;只要你们在所信的道上恒心，根基稳固，坚定不移，不至被引动失去福音的盼望。这福音就是你们所听过的，也是传与普天下万人听的，我—保罗也作了这福音的执事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;现在我为你们受苦，倒觉欢乐；并且为基督的身体，就是为教会，要在我肉身上补满基督患难的缺欠。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;我照　神为你们所赐我的职分作了教会的执事，要把　神的道理传得全备，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001026",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:26",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001026",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>26</sup>&nbsp;这道理就是历世历代所隐藏的奥秘；但如今向他的圣徒显明了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001027",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:27",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001027",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>27</sup>&nbsp;神愿意叫他们知道，这奥秘在外邦人中有何等丰盛的荣耀，就是基督在你们心里成了有荣耀的盼望。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001028",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:28",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001028",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>28</sup>&nbsp;我们传扬他，是用诸般的智慧，劝戒各人，教导各人，要把各人在基督里完完全全地引到　神面前。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051001029",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 1:29",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51001029",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>29</sup>&nbsp;我也为此劳苦，照着他在我里面运用的大能尽心竭力。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;我愿意你们晓得，我为你们和老底嘉人，并一切没有与我亲自见面的人，是何等地尽心竭力；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;要叫他们的心得安慰，因爱心互相联络，以致丰丰足足在悟性中有充足的信心，使他们真知　神的奥秘，就是基督；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;所积蓄的一切智慧知识，都在他里面藏着。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;我说这话，免得有人用花言巧语迷惑你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;我身子虽与你们相离，心却与你们同在，见你们循规蹈矩，信基督的心也坚固，我就欢喜了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你们既然接受了主基督耶稣，就当遵他而行，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;在他里面生根建造，信心坚固，正如你们所领的教训，感谢的心也更增长了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;你们要谨慎，恐怕有人用他的理学和虚空的妄言，不照着基督，乃照人间的遗传和世上的小学就把你们掳去。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;因为　神本性一切的丰盛都有形有体地居住在基督里面，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;你们在他里面也得了丰盛。他是各样执政掌权者的元首。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;你们在他里面也受了不是人手所行的割礼，乃是基督使你们脱去肉体情欲的割礼。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;你们既受洗与他一同埋葬，也就在此与他一同复活，都因信那叫他从死里复活　神的功用。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;你们从前在过犯和未受割礼的肉体中死了，　神赦免了你们一切过犯，便叫你们与基督一同活过来；</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;又涂抹了在律例上所写、攻击我们、有碍于我们的字据，把它撤去，钉在十字架上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;既将一切执政的、掌权的掳来，明显给众人看，就仗着十字架夸胜。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;所以，不拘在饮食上，或节期、月朔、安息日都不可让人论断你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;这些原是后事的影儿；那形体却是基督。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;不可让人因着故意谦虚和敬拜天使，就夺去你们的奖赏。这等人拘泥在所见过的，随着自己的欲心，无故地自高自大，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;不持定元首。全身既然靠着他，筋节得以相助联络，就因　神大得长进。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:20-21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20-21</sup>&nbsp;你们若是与基督同死，脱离了世上的小学，为什么仍像在世俗中活着、服从那「不可拿、不可尝、不可摸」等类的规条呢？</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;这都是照人所吩咐、所教导的。说到这一切，正用的时候就都败坏了。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051002023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 2:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51002023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;这些规条使人徒有智慧之名，用私意崇拜，自表谦卑，苦待己身，其实在克制肉体的情欲上是毫无功效。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;所以，你们若真与基督一同复活，就当求在上面的事；那里有基督坐在　神的右边。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你们要思念上面的事，不要思念地上的事。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;因为你们已经死了，你们的生命与基督一同藏在　神里面。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;基督是我们的生命，他显现的时候，你们也要与他一同显现在荣耀里。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;所以，要治死你们在地上的肢体，就如淫乱、污秽、邪情、恶欲，和贪婪（贪婪就与拜偶像一样）。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;因这些事，　神的忿怒必临到那悖逆之子。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;当你们在这些事中活着的时候，也曾这样行过。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;但现在你们要弃绝这一切的事，以及恼恨、忿怒、恶毒、毁谤，并口中污秽的言语。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;不要彼此说谎；因你们已经脱去旧人和旧人的行为，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;穿上了新人。这新人在知识上渐渐更新，正如造他主的形象。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;在此并不分希腊人、犹太人，受割礼的、未受割礼的，化外人、西古提人，为奴的、自主的，惟有基督是包括一切，又住在各人之内。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;所以，你们既是　神的选民，圣洁蒙爱的人，就要存怜悯、恩慈、谦虚、温柔、忍耐的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;倘若这人与那人有嫌隙，总要彼此包容，彼此饶恕；主怎样饶恕了你们，你们也要怎样饶恕人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;在这一切之外，要存着爱心，爱心就是联络全德的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;又要叫基督的平安在你们心里作主；你们也为此蒙召，归为一体；且要存感谢的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;当用各样的智慧，把基督的道理丰丰富富地存在心里，用诗章、颂词、灵歌，彼此教导，互相劝戒，心被恩感，歌颂　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;无论做什么，或说话或行事，都要奉主耶稣的名，借着他感谢父　神。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;你们作妻子的，当顺服自己的丈夫，这在主里面是相宜的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003019",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:19",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003019",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>19</sup>&nbsp;你们作丈夫的，要爱你们的妻子，不可苦待她们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003020",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:20",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003020",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>20</sup>&nbsp;你们作儿女的，要凡事听从父母，因为这是主所喜悦的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003021",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:21",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003021",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>21</sup>&nbsp;你们作父亲的，不要惹儿女的气，恐怕他们失了志气。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003022",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:22",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003022",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>22</sup>&nbsp;你们作仆人的，要凡事听从你们肉身的主人，不要只在眼前事奉，像是讨人喜欢的，总要存心诚实敬畏主。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003023",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:23",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003023",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>23</sup>&nbsp;无论做什么，都要从心里做，像是给主做的，不是给人做的，</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003024",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:24",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003024",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>24</sup>&nbsp;因你们知道从主那里必得着基业为赏赐；你们所事奉的乃是主基督。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051003025",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 3:25",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51003025",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>25</sup>&nbsp;那行不义的必受不义的报应；主并不偏待人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004001",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:1",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004001",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>1</sup>&nbsp;你们作主人的，要公公平平地待仆人，因为知道你们也有一位主在天上。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004002",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:2",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004002",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>2</sup>&nbsp;你们要恒切祷告，在此警醒感恩。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004003",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:3",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004003",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>3</sup>&nbsp;也要为我们祷告，求　神给我们开传道的门，能以讲基督的奥秘（我为此被捆锁），</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004004",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:4",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004004",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>4</sup>&nbsp;叫我按着所该说的话将这奥秘发明出来。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004005",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:5",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004005",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>5</sup>&nbsp;你们要爱惜光阴，用智慧与外人交往。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004006",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:6",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004006",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>6</sup>&nbsp;你们的言语要常常带着和气，好像用盐调和，就可知道该怎样回答各人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004007",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:7",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004007",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>7</sup>&nbsp;有我亲爱的兄弟推基古要将我一切的事都告诉你们。他是忠心的执事，和我一同作主的仆人。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004008",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:8",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004008",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>8</sup>&nbsp;我特意打发他到你们那里去，好叫你们知道我们的光景，又叫他安慰你们的心。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004009",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:9",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004009",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>9</sup>&nbsp;我又打发一位亲爱忠心的兄弟阿尼西谋同去；他也是你们那里的人。他们要把这里一切的事都告诉你们。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004010",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:10",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004010",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>10</sup>&nbsp;与我一同坐监的亚里达古问你们安。巴拿巴的表弟马可也问你们安。（说到这马可，你们已经受了吩咐；他若到了你们那里，你们就接待他。）</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004011",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:11",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004011",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>11</sup>&nbsp;耶数又称为犹士都，也问你们安。奉割礼的人中，只有这三个人是为　神的国与我一同做工的，也是叫我心里得安慰的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004012",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:12",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004012",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>12</sup>&nbsp;有你们那里的人，作基督耶稣仆人的以巴弗问你们安。他在祷告之间，常为你们竭力地祈求，愿你们在　神一切的旨意上得以完全，信心充足，能站立得稳。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004013",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:13",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004013",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>13</sup>&nbsp;他为你们和老底嘉并希拉坡里的弟兄多多地劳苦，这是我可以给他作见证的。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004014",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:14",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004014",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>14</sup>&nbsp;所亲爱的医生路加和底马问你们安。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004015",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:15",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004015",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>15</sup>&nbsp;请问老底嘉的弟兄和宁法，并她家里的教会安。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004016",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:16",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004016",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>16</sup>&nbsp;你们念了这书信，便交给老底嘉的教会，叫他们也念；你们也要念从老底嘉来的书信。</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004017",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:17",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004017",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>17</sup>&nbsp;要对亚基布说：「务要谨慎，尽你从主所受的职分。」</p>"
  },
  {
    "content_id": "10051004018",
    "version": "1.0.2",
    "title": "歌罗西书 4:18",
    "media_type": "Text",
    "index_reference": "51004018",
    "language": "zhs",
    "review_level": "Professional",
    "content": "<p><sup>18</sup>&nbsp;我—保罗亲笔问你们安。你们要记念我的捆锁。愿恩惠常与你们同在！</p>"
  }
]